{"title":"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 28","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The product of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/2/8c29fdb6ae261b4e5744577665c9da8f1026f88d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15^8\\cdot28^6\\cdot5^{11}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"98\" height=\"15\" /> is an integer number whose last digits are zeros. How many zeros are there?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/a/37aabea99a8275ea4def14e739238bf575384f81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\ } 6\\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\ } 8\\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\ } 11\\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\ } 12\\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\ } 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"369\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The number of zeros at the end of a number is determined by the number of 2's and 5's in its <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Prime_factorization\" title=\"Prime factorization\">prime factorization</a>.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/0/fc07c2248d8e5499f5b5103895037f0c94c86d74.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$15^8\\cdot28^6\\cdot5^{11}=2^{12}\\cdot3^8\\cdot5^{19}\\cdot7^6$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"242\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>There are 12 <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />'s and 19 <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />'s. Each pair adds a zero, but any extras don't count (in this case, the 7 extra <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />'s).\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/1/97175aff5257043064a51c4a4e5c9c489e1b6df7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{ D}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"12\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_28&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2007 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_27\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 27\">Problem 27</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_29\" title=\"2007 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 2